# Example action used by the action demo.
#
# Three sections separated by '---':
#   goal     : sent once by the client when starting the task
#   result   : delivered once when the task finishes
#   feedback : streamed zero or more times while the task runs
#
# Here the server computes the first `order` numbers of the Fibonacci
# sequence, streaming the partial sequence as feedback.
int32 order
---
int32[] sequence
---
int32[] partial_sequence
